{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c08-t8.ex-p020","chapter":8,"chapterTitle":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","topic":"8.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৮.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৮.২","kind":"exercise","page":175,"text":"৩. $\\sin A = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}$ এবং $\\frac{\\pi}{2} < A < \\pi$ এর ক্ষেত্রে $\\cos A$ এবং $\\tan A$ এর মান কত?","image":null,"verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c08-t8.ex-p021","chapter":8,"chapterTitle":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","topic":"8.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৮.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৮.২","kind":"exercise","page":175,"text":"৪. দেওয়া আছে, $\\cos A = \\frac{1}{2}$ এবং $\\cos A$ ও $\\sin A$ একই চিহ্নবিশিষ্ট। $\\sin A$ ও $\\tan A$ এর মান কত?","image":null,"verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
