{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c08-t8.ex-p030","chapter":8,"chapterTitle":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","topic":"8.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৮.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৮.২","kind":"exercise","page":175,"text":"৭. যদি $cosec A = \\frac{a}{b}$ হয়, যেখানে $a > b > 0$, তবে প্রমাণ করো যে, $\\tan A = \\frac{\\pm b}{\\sqrt{a^2 - b^2}}$","image":null,"verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c08-t8.ex-p031","chapter":8,"chapterTitle":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","topic":"8.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৮.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৮.২","kind":"exercise","page":175,"text":"৮. যদি $\\cos \\theta - \\sin \\theta = \\sqrt{2} \\sin \\theta$ হয়, তবে দেখাও যে, $\\cos \\theta + \\sin \\theta = \\sqrt{2} \\cos \\theta$","image":null,"verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c08-t8.ex-p032","chapter":8,"chapterTitle":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","topic":"8.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৮.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৮.২","kind":"exercise","page":175,"text":"৯. $\\tan \\theta = \\frac{x}{y}, x \\neq y$ হলে, $\\frac{x \\sin \\theta + y \\cos \\theta}{x \\sin \\theta - y \\cos \\theta}$ এর মান নির্ণয় করো।","image":null,"verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c08-t8.ex-p033","chapter":8,"chapterTitle":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","topic":"8.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ৮.১","section":"অনুশীলনী ৮.২","kind":"exercise","page":175,"text":"১০. $\\tan \\theta + \\sec \\theta = x$ হলে, দেখাও যে, $\\sin \\theta = \\frac{x^2 - 1}{x^2 + 1}$","image":null,"verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
